This license covers the files written for this project. Third-party code
keeps its own license:

- doom/src/   Doom source via doomgeneric (https://github.com/ozkl/doomgeneric),
              GNU GPL v2, see doom/src/LICENSE. One file (w_file_stdc.c) is
              modified to use this project's file layer.
- bench/coremark/  CoreMark port files from EEMBC's barebones template,
              Apache 2.0, see bench/coremark/LICENSE.md.
- Linux kernel image used by the Linux milestones (`linux/vmlinux.bin`, `linux/linux.dtb`,
  generated initramfs/rootfs, and `linux/gate.txt`) is not committed in git. It is generated
  from the committed Buildroot 2025.02.19 recipe/config (`make linux_rebuild_kernel`) and
  distributed as a GitHub Release asset. The kernel is GPLv2 Linux 6.12.27; BusyBox (GPL) and
  uClibc-ng (LGPL) may also be included in the initramfs. Upstream source locations: kernel
  https://www.kernel.org/, BusyBox https://git.busybox.net/busybox, uClibc-ng https://github.com/frc00d1/uclibc-ng,
  Buildroot https://git.busybox.net/buildroot.
- FreeRTOS kernel (MIT) is not in this repo; `make deps` fetches it. The port
              in os/freertos/ is this project's own code.
- env/        Test harness headers following the riscv-tests conventions,
              see env/LICENSE.riscv-tests (BSD).

The Doom shareware WAD (doom1.wad, (c) id Software) is NOT included.
